- Description: Home to the world’s tallest trees, with landscapes from prairies and oak woodlands to rivers and rugged coastline. This ancient homeland has supported people for thousands of years. Managed jointly by the National Park Service and California State Parks to protect and restore the area for enjoyment, learning, and inspiration.

