- Address: 1111 Second Street, Crescent City, CA 95531

Visitor Information
- Weather: Cool and damp; dress in layers and expect wet conditions. Typical coastal temperatures year-round mid-40s°F (7°C) to mid-60s°F (18°C); summers can be foggy, occasionally low 70s°F (20°C). Winters are cooler with heavy rain. Oct–Apr averages 60–80 inches of rainfall.
- Directions: Northernmost coastal California, near the Oregon border; park spans ~60 miles with four visitor centers from north to south. Approximate drive times: 6–7 hours (325 mi) north of San Francisco; 6 hours (330 mi) south of Portland, OR; 4 hours (170 mi) west of Redding, CA.
