Core contribution and results
- 7B-parameter language model optimized for performance and efficiency.
- Outperforms Llama 2 13B across all evaluated benchmarks; surpasses Llama 1 34B in reasoning, mathematics, and code generation.
- Key techniques:
  - Grouped-Query Attention (GQA) for faster inference.
  - Sliding Window Attention (SWA) to handle arbitrarily long sequences at reduced inference cost.
- Instruction-tuned variant (Mistral 7B — Instruct) outperforms Llama 2 13B — Chat on human and automated benchmarks.

