  - Entrance – Motorcycle: $25.00 (per motorcycle).
  - Entrance – Per Person: $15.00 (on foot or bike).

- Entrance Passes:
  - Annual Entrance – Park: $55.00; valid 12 months; covers signee + accompanying passengers in a single non-commercial vehicle. Available at entrance stations and visitor centers.

- Operating Hours:
  - Park open 24/7, year-round.
