General regulations and tips
- Bears are active; store all food/scented items in provided metal lockers.
- Pets: permitted in campgrounds on leashes ≤6 ft; not allowed on any park trails (including in backpacks).
- Some campgrounds have gates that open/close at noon on opening/closing dates. Where noted, check-in is 12 pm or later; checkout before 12 pm. Reserved sites may be released if not occupied by noon on day 2.
- Firewood: buy locally; do not cut standing/living trees.
- Cell service is limited; if using Recreation.gov app for payments, download it before arrival. Water may be seasonal in spring/fall—plan accordingly.
- Park info: 559-565-3341 (voice), 559-565-3730 (fax). SEKI_Information@nps.gov (most campgrounds). Park regs: https://www.nps.gov/seki/planyourvisit/cg_regs.htm

Atwell Mill Campground (SEKI)
