- Location/elevation: Along East Fork Kaweah River; near Silver City Resort (1.7 mi E); 23 mi/1.5 hr to Three Rivers; 6,650 ft.
- Fees: $32/night; Senior/Access: $16.
- Sites/types: 21 total; 21 reservable; tent-only; no RVs/trailers.
- Amenities: Trash/recycling; vault toilets (seasonal); potable water (seasonal); food lockers; staff host; camp store; dump station; limited cell; no showers; internet connectivity; laundry; amphitheater; ice/firewood for sale.
- Accessibility/roads: Unpaved, rutted, uneven roads. No accessible sites yet. Access road unpaved (OK in good weather). No RVs/trailers.
- Weather: Warm/sunny summers; rapid changes possible; prepare for 3-season camping.
