- end_time (string date-time, optional): Newest UTC timestamp (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ). Second granularity. Exclusive.
- since_id (string, optional): Return results with Post ID greater than this. Pattern: ^[0-9]{1,19}$ (Tweet IDs are strings to avoid large integer issues).
- until_id (string, optional): Return results with Post ID less than this. Pattern: ^[0-9]{1,19}$.
- max_results (integer, optional): Number of results to return. Min 10, max 100, default 10.
- next_token (string, optional): Base36 pagination token from prior response. Do not modify.
- pagination_token (string, optional): Base36 pagination token from prior response. Do not modify.
- sort_order (string, optional): recency | relevancy.
- tweet.fields (CSV as form, explode=false): Tweet fields to return. Allowed values:
